{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save all of humanity from Death in this epic, fantasy quest of vengeance and beat-em-up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omnicide wiped out all of humanity in an instant. Billions of souls, sent to The Void for to fuel Death's mysterious plans - but you survivied. Now, seek vengeance for all of humanity through 4 unique environments, fighting hordes of crystalline legionnaires, powerful gods and Death herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your powers and where they came from through 3rd person action combat, using fighting-game inspired combos to obliterate hordes of breakable enemies. Use your extensive movement abilities to dodge the attacks of gods more powerful than you, and strike when they are weak. Seek vengeance, For All Our Souls!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914840?t=1755183531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914840?t=1755183531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914840/e84561fde0cc7576c73f0f024d44d130d0c771ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755183531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914840/e84561fde0cc7576c73f0f024d44d130d0c771ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755183531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save all of humanity from Death in this epic, fantasy quest of vengeance and beat-em-up combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Omnicide wiped out all of humanity in an instant. Billions of souls, sent to The Void for to fuel Death's mysterious plans - but you survivied. Now, seek vengeance for all of humanity through 4 unique environments, fighting hordes of crystalline legionnaires, powerful gods and Death herself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover your powers and where they came from through 3rd person action combat, using fighting-game inspired combos to obliterate hordes of breakable enemies. Use your extensive movement abilities to dodge the attacks of gods more powerful than you, and strike when they are weak. Seek vengeance, For All Our Souls!</p>","developers":["Shrimp Made Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914840/9dc8909c99f4b8b73fbe08e2974329d4185f6e9e/header.jpg?t=1755183531","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914840/1327187574/3810634d8ff07d47299faa815e9396e1063ef3d2/1754354447/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755128089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914840/1327187574/3810634d8ff07d47299faa815e9396e1063ef3d2/1754354447/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755128089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914840/1327187574/3810634d8ff07d47299faa815e9396e1063ef3d2/1754354447/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755128089","id":257178221,"name":"For_All_Our_Souls_Alpha_Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178221/872ec7b09618efec77f624ca0bd1e6f1702c711d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755128089"}],"name":"For All Our Souls","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>R